application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "9102560149856027", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25720183927667054"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1781017008, "id": "27079286328423467", "version": "0.9.7.32", "version_code": 41, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "9102560149856027", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25720183927667054"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1409588367087137"}]}, "change_log": "\u2600\ufe0f Update #19: SUMMER HAS ARRIVED\n\nVersion 0.9.7.31\n\nSummer has finally reached the haunted house.\n\nWhile the ghosts never take a vacation, we've been busy behind the scenes making everything run a little smoother.\n\n\u2728 General stability improvements\n\u2728 Minor bug fixes\n\u2728 Performance optimizations\n\nThe haunting never stops...\n\nStay spooky. \ud83d\udc7b\n\n\u2728 Update #18: A NEW SEASON BEGINS\n\nVersion 0.9.7.30\n\nChristmas is over.\n\nThe New Year celebrations have faded\u2026 and even winter is slowly coming to an end.\n\nThe house and HUB have returned to their original haunted state, as the last traces of holiday magic disappear \ud83d\udc7b\n\nThis update clears the path for what comes next.\n\nNew haunts are already taking shape.\n\nStay spooky. \ud83d\udc7b\n\n---\n\n\ud83c\udf84 Update #17: THE CHRISTMAS HAUNTING HAS BEGUN!\n\nVersion 0.9.7.30\n\nWelcome to the Christmas update of You Are Ghost \u2014 where holiday magic meets spooky mischief, and even Santa isn\u2019t as kind as he seems\u2026\n\n\ud83c\udf85 Santa Grandpa Has Arrived\u2026 and He\u2019s Not Jolly\n\nGrandpa has fully embraced the holidays \u2014 now dressed as a dark, mischievous Evil Santa.\n\nDon\u2019t expect kindness\u2026 expect traps, surprises, and a very strange version of \u201cho-ho-ho\u201d.\n\n\u2744\ufe0f Christmas Takes Over the HUB & the Entire House\n\nBoth the HUB and the haunted house are now fully transformed into magical winter locations:\n\n\u2728 shimmering garlands everywhere\n\u2728 festive lights dancing across walls and ceilings\n\u2728 cozy Christmas decorations in every room\n\u2728 warm holiday glow mixed with eerie haunted vibes\n\n\ud83c\udf81 Three New Holiday Bundles Arrive!\n\nMeet our brand-new festive bundles:\n\n\ud83c\udf85 Merry Crisis Bundle \u2013 Soft velvet gloves, candy-red details, and that warm \u201cho-ho-ho but also chaos\u201d energy.\n\ud83d\udc9a Stolen Christmas Bundle \u2013 Fuzzy, green, and delightfully naughty \u2014 perfect for stealing Grandpa\u2019s holiday spirit.\n\ud83d\udd2e Platform 6 Bundle \u2013 Snowy sparkles, enchanted shimmer, and a dash of winter magic swirling around your hands.\n\nDress up, glow up, and haunt in true holiday style!\n\n\ud83c\udfae Play now: vr.meta.me/s/1XQTSmiyUt8Y1Mf\n\ud83d\udc7b Join our cozy haunted Discord: discord.gg/KWbBb9dgPV\n\nStay spooky \u2014 stay merry \u2014 and enjoy the most haunted Christmas ever! \ud83c\udf84\ud83d\udc7b\u2728", "created_date": 1781016616, "id": "27079216301763803", "version": "0.9.7.31", "version_code": 40, "release_status": "SCHEDULED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}